 ted stand-up in Boston and now splits his time between New York City and to
 uring. In 2021\, he founded Next Stop Comedy\, a stand-up organization that
  brings comedians to 100+ venues all over the country. More recently\, his 
 videos have amassed over 1.5 million views on Instagram\, in just a couple 
 of weeks. When he’s not on stage\, he’s probably filming another sketch
